      ("Which Western European city offers the best value for remote workers?","Valencia-equivalent Spain, Porto, Madrid (relative to northern peers) and Lisbon's outer rings consistently deliver the best quality-per-euro at roughly €1,600–€2,400 per month single all-in. Dublin, Amsterdam and the Swiss cities sit at the opposite pole — €3,000–€4,500+ — justified mainly by salary opportunities and community fit."),
