    "<strong>Banking:</strong> card acceptance is strong in Almaty and Tashkent cores but cash-primary elsewhere; Kazakhstan's Kaspi ecosystem is a parallel internet of payments — set it up on arrival.",
    "<strong>Connectivity kit:</strong> local SIMs are cheap and fast in cities; for mountain legs, satellite messengers (not phone tethering) are the responsible baseline.",
    "<strong>Seasons:</strong> April–June and September–October are the sweet spot; continental winters bite (Astana regularly sees −20°C and below), summers scorch the lowlands while the hills shine.",
